    "introduction": "Lion Finance Group provides banking and financial services with a focus on Georgia and Armenia. Its businesses serve individuals, small companies and larger corporate customers through lending, deposits, payments and other banking products. Revenue comes from interest and service fees, supported by local customer franchises and digital channels. Economic growth and financial activity in its core markets influence borrowing and transaction demand. As a banking group, it must manage credit losses, funding and regulatory capital while maintaining reliable services. Its geographic concentration makes local economic, currency and political conditions particularly relevant, alongside the execution of its retail and business-banking strategies.",
